+/* NVIDIA faults when drawing into a linear color attachment while a depth or
+ * stencil attachment is bound, which every HWUI window does.  ANB images from
+ * grallocs without a GPU are linear, so render them through an optimal shadow
+ * image that vn_QueueSignalReleaseImageANDROID copies to the linear image.
